  "details": "Prepare the following U# code.\n\n```\n\npublic class HelloWorld : UdonSharpBehaviour {\n\n    public int MethodWithReturnValue() {\n\n        return 0;\n\n    }\n\n}\n\n```\n\nThe Udon assembly that the U# compiler writes from this code is as follows.\n\n```\n\n.data_start\n\n    __refl_typeid: %SystemInt64, null\n\n    __refl_typename: %SystemString, null\n\n    __intnl_returnJump_SystemUInt32_0: %SystemUInt32, null\n\n    __0_MethodWithReturnValue__ret: %SystemInt32, null\n\n    __const_SystemUInt32_0: %SystemUInt32, null\n\n    __const_SystemInt32_0: %SystemInt32, null\n\n.data_end\n\n.code_start\n\n    .export MethodWithReturnValue\n\n    MethodWithReturnValue:\n\n        PUSH, __const_SystemUInt32_0\n\n# \n\n# HelloWorld.MethodWithReturnValue()\n\n# \n\n        PUSH, __const_SystemInt32_0\n\n        PUSH, __0_MethodWithReturnValue__ret\n\n        COPY\n\n        PUSH, __intnl_returnJump_SystemUInt32_0\n\n        COPY\n\n        JUMP_INDIRECT, __intnl_returnJump_SystemUInt32_0\n\n        PUSH, __intnl_returnJump_SystemUInt32_0\n\n        COPY\n\n        JUMP_INDIRECT, __intnl_returnJump_SystemUInt32_0\n\n.code_end\n\n```\n\nThe Udon assembly between lines 22 and 24 is never executed. It also overlaps with lines 19 to 21.\n\nI think this is unnecessary Udon assembly, so I would like it not to be output.",
